  "folder": "dIbTKQdDuf3aez6C",
  "name": "World Population, or, Who ARE These People?",
  "_id": "hMdAKu3qrdDf5mAY",
  "pages": [
    {
      "sort": 100000,
      "name": "If You Build It ... WTF?",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "ckyiJW1YVXRPOZ2m",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4377\">🜂 PLAYER GUIDE</h1><h2 data-start=\"4378\" data-end=\"4412\">Managing the People of Your Hex</h2><hr data-start=\"4442\" data-end=\"4445\"><h3 data-start=\"4447\" data-end=\"4470\">Who Are The People?</h3><p data-start=\"4472\" data-end=\"4511\">The people in your hex are not imports.</p><p data-start=\"4513\" data-end=\"4575\">They arrive when your hex becomes stable enough to hold lives.</p><p data-start=\"4577\" data-end=\"4592\">When you build:</p><ul data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4635\"><li data-start=\"4594\" data-end=\"4601\"><p data-start=\"4596\" data-end=\"4601\">Homes</p></li><li data-start=\"4602\" data-end=\"4609\"><p data-start=\"4604\" data-end=\"4609\">Walls</p></li><li data-start=\"4610\" data-end=\"4619\"><p data-start=\"4612\" data-end=\"4619\">Markets</p></li><li data-start=\"4620\" data-end=\"4635\"><p data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4635\">Faith centers</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4637\" data-end=\"4663\">People resolve into place.</p><p data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4698\">If your hex thrives, more arrive.</p><p data-start=\"4700\" data-end=\"4728\">If it fractures, fewer stay.</p><hr data-start=\"4730\" data-end=\"4733\"><h3 data-start=\"4735\" data-end=\"4766\">Why Do They Match Our Vibe?</h3><p data-start=\"4768\" data-end=\"4806\">Because your faction shapes resonance.</p><p data-start=\"4808\" data-end=\"4890\">Your politics, economy, faith, and morale influence what kind of people stabilize.</p><p data-start=\"4892\" data-end=\"4922\">If you build a militant state:</p><p data-start=\"4924\" data-end=\"4941\">You get soldiers.</p><p data-start=\"4943\" data-end=\"4968\">If you build a trade hub:</p><p data-start=\"4970\" data-end=\"4988\">You get merchants.</p><p data-start=\"4990\" data-end=\"5038\">If you build a fractured ideological experiment:</p><p data-start=\"5040\" data-end=\"5056\">You get tension.</p><hr data-start=\"5058\" data-end=\"5061\"><h3 data-start=\"5063\" data-end=\"5086\">Who Runs Garrisons?</h3><p data-start=\"5088\" data-end=\"5132\">Your garrisons are staffed by townsfolk who:</p><ul data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5217\"><li data-start=\"5134\" data-end=\"5159\"><p data-start=\"5136\" data-end=\"5159\">Believe in your faction</p></li><li data-start=\"5160\" data-end=\"5184\"><p data-start=\"5162\" data-end=\"5184\">Rely on your stability</p></li><li data-start=\"5185\" data-end=\"5217\"><p data-start=\"5187\" data-end=\"5217\">Are trained by your structures</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5219\" data-end=\"5239\">They are not heroes.</p><p data-start=\"5241\" data-end=\"5270\">They are your responsibility.</p><hr data-start=\"5272\" data-end=\"5275\"><h3 data-start=\"5277\" data-end=\"5303\">What Happens In Raids?</h3><p data-start=\"5305\" data-end=\"5333\">When structures take damage:</p><p data-start=\"5335\" data-end=\"5356\">That means real loss.</p><p data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5408\">Walls collapse.<br>Watch rotations break.<br>People die.</p><p data-start=\"5410\" data-end=\"5432\">Heavy casualties will:</p><ul data-start=\"5434\" data-end=\"5502\"><li data-start=\"5434\" data-end=\"5448\"><p data-start=\"5436\" data-end=\"5448\">Lower morale</p></li><li data-start=\"5449\" data-end=\"5466\"><p data-start=\"5451\" data-end=\"5466\">Increase unrest</p></li><li data-start=\"5467\" data-end=\"5502\"><p data-start=\"5469\" data-end=\"5502\">Make your hex harder to stabilize</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5520\">You can rebuild.</p><p data-start=\"5522\" data-end=\"5559\">But it takes effort to restore trust.</p><hr data-start=\"5561\" data-end=\"5564\"><h3 data-start=\"5566\" data-end=\"5591\">Can New Heroes Arise?</h3><p data-start=\"5593\" data-end=\"5605\">Very rarely.</p><p data-start=\"5607\" data-end=\"5709\">If your hex becomes narratively intense enough,<br>a person may rise from the population and become more.</p><p data-start=\"5711\" data-end=\"5734\">That is not guaranteed.</p><p data-start=\"5736\" data-end=\"5755\">But it is possible.</p><hr data-start=\"5757\" data-end=\"5760\"><h3 data-start=\"5762\" data-end=\"5787\">Why Stability Matters</h3><p data-start=\"5789\" data-end=\"5810\">If you keep your hex:</p><ul data-start=\"5812\" data-end=\"5859\"><li data-start=\"5812\" data-end=\"5824\"><p data-start=\"5814\" data-end=\"5824\">Integrated</p></li><li data-start=\"5825\" data-end=\"5836\"><p data-start=\"5827\" data-end=\"5836\">Resourced</p></li><li data-start=\"5837\" data-end=\"5859\"><p data-start=\"5839\" data-end=\"5859\">Politically coherent</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5861\" data-end=\"5888\">Population grows naturally.</p><p data-start=\"5890\" data-end=\"5914\">If you let chaos spread:</p><p data-start=\"5916\" data-end=\"5944\">People stop resolving there.</p><p data-start=\"5946\" data-end=\"5971\">Your hex will feel empty.</p><p data-start=\"5973\" data-end=\"5987\">Because it is.</p><hr data-start=\"5989\" data-end=\"5992\"><h1 data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"246\">🜁 GM CANON ENTRY</h1><h2 data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"268\">The Echo Lifecycle</h2><blockquote data-start=\"270\" data-end=\"335\"><p data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"335\"><em data-start=\"272\" data-end=\"335\">“No one arrives from nowhere.<br data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"305\">They arrive from unfinished.”</em></p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"337\" data-end=\"340\"><h2 data-start=\"342\" data-end=\"362\">I. The Storehouse</h2><p data-start=\"364\" data-end=\"452\">Beneath all hexes, beneath even the Leylines, exists the <strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"451\">Great Storehouse of Images</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"493\">It is not a place.<br data-start=\"472\" data-end=\"475\">It is a condition.</p><p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"618\">Every life that has ever occurred — across all worlds, timelines, failed realities, and broken cosmologies — leaves behind:</p><ul data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"698\"><li data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"641\"><p data-start=\"622\" data-end=\"641\">A narrative imprint</p></li><li data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"666\"><p data-start=\"644\" data-end=\"666\">A pattern of intention</p></li><li data-start=\"667\" data-end=\"698\"><p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"698\">A residue of unresolved drive</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"700\" data-end=\"739\">These imprints do not persist as souls.</p><p data-start=\"741\" data-end=\"768\">They persist as <strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"767\">Echoes</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"781\">An Echo is:</p><ul data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"918\"><li data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"826\"><p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"826\">A stable pattern of memory and motivation</p></li><li data-start=\"827\" data-end=\"861\"><p data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"861\">Detached from original biography</p></li><li data-start=\"862\" data-end=\"918\"><p data-start=\"864\" data-end=\"918\">Capable of re-instantiation under sufficient resonance</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"981\">The Storehouse is infinite.<br data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"950\">But it does not act on its own.</p><p data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1007\">It waits for invitation.</p><hr data-start=\"1009\" data-end=\"1012\"><h2 data-start=\"1014\" data-end=\"1046\">II. Resonance &amp; Manifestation</h2><p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1111\">A hex becomes capable of sustaining population when it reaches:</p><ul data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1223\"><li data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1141\"><p data-start=\"1115\" data-end=\"1141\">Sufficient <strong data-start=\"1126\" data-end=\"1141\">Development</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1170\"><p data-start=\"1144\" data-end=\"1170\">Sufficient <strong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1170\">Integration</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1223\"><p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1223\">Narrative stability (low chaos, or coherent chaos)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1255\">When those conditions are met:</p><blockquote data-start=\"1257\" data-end=\"1293\"><p data-start=\"1259\" data-end=\"1293\">The hex achieves Resonant Density.</p></blockquote><p data-start=\"1295\" data-end=\"1358\">At Resonant Density, compatible Echoes resolve into embodiment.</p><p data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1384\">This is not immigration.</p><p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1407\">This is condensation.</p><p data-start=\"1409\" data-end=\"1424\">They appear as:</p><ul data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1513\"><li data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1435\"><p data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1435\">Farmers</p></li><li data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1447\"><p data-start=\"1438\" data-end=\"1447\">Engineers</p></li><li data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1458\"><p data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1458\">Soldiers</p></li><li data-start=\"1459\" data-end=\"1467\"><p data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1467\">Clerks</p></li><li data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1478\"><p data-start=\"1470\" data-end=\"1478\">Children</p></li><li data-start=\"1479\" data-end=\"1489\"><p data-start=\"1481\" data-end=\"1489\">Faithful</p></li><li data-start=\"1490\" data-end=\"1502\"><p data-start=\"1492\" data-end=\"1502\">Dissidents</p></li><li data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1513\"><p data-start=\"1505\" data-end=\"1513\">Artisans</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1578\">They have continuity of self.<br>They do not remember prior lives.</p><p data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1595\">But they carry:</p><ul data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1655\"><li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1605\"><p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1605\">Skills</p></li><li data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1619\"><p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1619\">Temperament</p></li><li data-start=\"1620\" data-end=\"1634\"><p data-start=\"1622\" data-end=\"1634\">Dispositions</p></li><li data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1655\"><p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1655\">Philosophical lean</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1657\" data-end=\"1789\">A theocratic hex resolves pious Echoes.<br>An industrial hex resolves labor-oriented Echoes.<br>A fractured hex resolves desperate Echoes.</p><hr data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1794\"><h2 data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1817\">III. Stabilization</h2><p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1844\">Echoes stabilize through:</p><ul data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1936\"><li data-start=\"1846\" data-end=\"1864\"><p data-start=\"1848\" data-end=\"1864\">Social structure</p></li><li data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1882\"><p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1882\">Economic rhythm</p></li><li data-start=\"1883\" data-end=\"1904\"><p data-start=\"1885\" data-end=\"1904\">Political coherence</p></li><li data-start=\"1905\" data-end=\"1936\"><p data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1936\">Factional narrative direction</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1938\" data-end=\"1967\">Once stabilized, they become:</p><blockquote data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1990\"><p data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1990\"><strong data-start=\"1971\" data-end=\"1990\">Anchored Echoes</strong></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"1992\" data-end=\"2013\">Anchored Echoes form:</p><ul data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2092\"><li data-start=\"2015\" data-end=\"2032\"><p data-start=\"2017\" data-end=\"2032\">Town population</p></li><li data-start=\"2033\" data-end=\"2044\"><p data-start=\"2035\" data-end=\"2044\">Garrisons</p></li><li data-start=\"2045\" data-end=\"2060\"><p data-start=\"2047\" data-end=\"2060\">Bureaucracies</p></li><li data-start=\"2061\" data-end=\"2073\"><p data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2073\">Work crews</p></li><li data-start=\"2074\" data-end=\"2092\"><p data-start=\"2076\" data-end=\"2092\">Religious bodies</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2094\" data-end=\"2110\">They are mortal.</p><p data-start=\"2112\" data-end=\"2121\">They age.</p><p data-start=\"2123\" data-end=\"2138\">They reproduce.</p><p data-start=\"2140\" data-end=\"2246\">Children are new instantiations of compatible Echo patterns, not biological souls imported from elsewhere.</p><hr data-start=\"2248\" data-end=\"2251\"><h2 data-start=\"2253\" data-end=\"2276\">IV. Garrison Reality</h2><p data-start=\"2278\" data-end=\"2319\">Garrisons are staffed by Anchored Echoes.</p><p data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2353\">When a garrison step is damaged:</p><p data-start=\"2355\" data-end=\"2369\">It represents:</p><ul data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2437\"><li data-start=\"2371\" data-end=\"2392\"><p data-start=\"2373\" data-end=\"2392\">Structural collapse</p></li><li data-start=\"2393\" data-end=\"2405\"><p data-start=\"2395\" data-end=\"2405\">Casualties</p></li><li data-start=\"2406\" data-end=\"2417\"><p data-start=\"2408\" data-end=\"2417\">Dispersal</p></li><li data-start=\"2418\" data-end=\"2437\"><p data-start=\"2420\" data-end=\"2437\">Loss of coherence</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2439\" data-end=\"2464\">When a step is destroyed:</p><p data-start=\"2466\" data-end=\"2477\">Echoes die.</p><p data-start=\"2479\" data-end=\"2506\">Their pattern destabilizes.</p><p data-start=\"2508\" data-end=\"2537\">It returns to the Storehouse.</p><p data-start=\"2539\" data-end=\"2553\">Not destroyed.</p><p data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2572\">Unresolved again.</p><hr data-start=\"2574\" data-end=\"2577\"><h2 data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2604\">V. Casualties in Raids</h2><p data-start=\"2606\" data-end=\"2616\">In a Raid:</p><p data-start=\"2618\" data-end=\"2649\">Heroes clash at the Node layer.</p><p data-start=\"2651\" data-end=\"2687\">Echoes absorb the consequence layer.</p><p data-start=\"2689\" data-end=\"2710\">Casualties represent:</p><ul data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2794\"><li data-start=\"2712\" data-end=\"2729\"><p data-start=\"2714\" data-end=\"2729\">Civilian deaths</p></li><li data-start=\"2730\" data-end=\"2747\"><p data-start=\"2732\" data-end=\"2747\">Garrison losses</p></li><li data-start=\"2748\" data-end=\"2773\"><p data-start=\"2750\" data-end=\"2773\">Infrastructure collapse</p></li><li data-start=\"2774\" data-end=\"2794\"><p data-start=\"2776\" data-end=\"2794\">Narrative thinning</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2796\" data-end=\"2819\">Mechanically, this can:</p><ul data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2962\"><li data-start=\"2821\" data-end=\"2841\"><p data-start=\"2823\" data-end=\"2841\">Reduce Integration</p></li><li data-start=\"2842\" data-end=\"2858\"><p data-start=\"2844\" data-end=\"2858\">Reduce Loyalty</p></li><li data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2878\"><p data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2878\">Increase Darkness</p></li><li data-start=\"2879\" data-end=\"2905\"><p data-start=\"2881\" data-end=\"2905\">Increase Political Drift</p></li><li data-start=\"2906\" data-end=\"2933\"><p data-start=\"2908\" data-end=\"2933\">Trigger Minority Pressure</p></li><li data-start=\"2934\" data-end=\"2962\"><p data-start=\"2936\" data-end=\"2962\">Destabilize population cap</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2964\" data-end=\"3003\">A hex with repeated casualties becomes:</p><blockquote data-start=\"3005\" data-end=\"3024\"><p data-start=\"3007\" data-end=\"3024\">Narratively thin.</p></blockquote><p data-start=\"3026\" data-end=\"3068\">Thin hexes struggle to sustain population.</p><p data-start=\"3070\" data-end=\"3100\">Echoes stop stabilizing there.</p><hr data-start=\"3102\" data-end=\"3105\"><h2 data-start=\"3107\" data-end=\"3137\">VI. Dissolution &amp; Migration</h2><p data-start=\"3139\" data-end=\"3177\">If a hex shifts ideology or alignment:</p><p data-start=\"3179\" data-end=\"3228\">Echoes misaligned with new resonance destabilize.</p><p data-start=\"3230\" data-end=\"3235\">They:</p><ul data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3348\"><li data-start=\"3237\" data-end=\"3258\"><p data-start=\"3239\" data-end=\"3258\">Leave (narratively)</p></li><li data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3296\"><p data-start=\"3261\" data-end=\"3296\">Become disaffected (drift pressure)</p></li><li data-start=\"3297\" data-end=\"3316\"><p data-start=\"3299\" data-end=\"3316\">Become insurgents</p></li><li data-start=\"3317\" data-end=\"3348\"><p data-start=\"3319\" data-end=\"3348\">Fade and re-resolve elsewhere</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3350\" data-end=\"3396\">Population change is metaphysical rebalancing.</p><hr data-start=\"3398\" data-end=\"3401\"><h2 data-start=\"3403\" data-end=\"3445\">VII. Echo Awakening (Optional GM Lever)</h2><p data-start=\"3447\" data-end=\"3454\">Rarely:</p><p data-start=\"3456\" data-end=\"3502\">Under extreme narrative pressure,<br>An Echo can:</p><ul data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3558\"><li data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3529\"><p data-start=\"3506\" data-end=\"3529\">Achieve Self-Continuity</p></li><li data-start=\"3530\" data-end=\"3543\"><p data-start=\"3532\" data-end=\"3543\">Generate OP</p></li><li data-start=\"3544\" data-end=\"3558\"><p data-start=\"3546\" data-end=\"3558\">Enter Roster</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3560\" data-end=\"3581\">This is hero genesis.</p><p data-start=\"3583\" data-end=\"3640\">It should be rare.<br>It should be costly.<br>It should matter.</p><hr data-start=\"3642\" data-end=\"3645\"><h2 data-start=\"3647\" data-end=\"3677\">VIII. Darkness &amp; Corruption</h2><p data-start=\"3679\" data-end=\"3726\">High Darkness hexes distort Echo manifestation.</p><p data-start=\"3728\" data-end=\"3745\">Possible effects:</p><ul data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3889\"><li data-start=\"3747\" data-end=\"3773\"><p data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3773\">Fragmented personalities</p></li><li data-start=\"3774\" data-end=\"3802\"><p data-start=\"3776\" data-end=\"3802\">Accelerated radicalization</p></li><li data-start=\"3803\" data-end=\"3813\"><p data-start=\"3805\" data-end=\"3813\">Fatalism</p></li><li data-start=\"3814\" data-end=\"3837\"><p data-start=\"3816\" data-end=\"3837\">Supernatural mutation</p></li><li data-start=\"3838\" data-end=\"3889\"><p data-start=\"3840\" data-end=\"3889\">Echo bleed (memories leaking from prior patterns)</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3891\" data-end=\"3919\">Extreme Darkness can create:</p><blockquote data-start=\"3921\" data-end=\"3975\"><p data-start=\"3923\" data-end=\"3975\">Hollow Echoes — animated patterns lacking coherence.</p></blockquote><p data-start=\"3977\" data-end=\"3997\">These are dangerous.</p><hr data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4002\"><h2 data-start=\"4004\" data-end=\"4029\">IX. Death Is Not Mercy</h2><p data-start=\"4031\" data-end=\"4047\">When Echoes die:</p><p data-start=\"4049\" data-end=\"4089\">Their pattern returns to the Storehouse.</p><p data-start=\"4091\" data-end=\"4143\">But repetition without resolution weakens coherence.</p><p data-start=\"4145\" data-end=\"4194\">Repeated death in similar conditions may produce:</p><ul data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4286\"><li data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4219\"><p data-start=\"4198\" data-end=\"4219\">Warped manifestations</p></li><li data-start=\"4220\" data-end=\"4238\"><p data-start=\"4222\" data-end=\"4238\">Trauma resonance</p></li><li data-start=\"4239\" data-end=\"4259\"><p data-start=\"4241\" data-end=\"4259\">Haunting phenomena</p></li><li data-start=\"4260\" data-end=\"4286\"><p data-start=\"4262\" data-end=\"4286\">Political radicalization</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4288\" data-end=\"4302\">Death matters.</p><p data-start=\"4304\" data-end=\"4351\">Because suffering accumulates in pattern-space.</p><p></p>"
      },
